        "mechanics_summary": "皮克斯跟随的英雄攻击时会发射可被其他单位阻挡的魔法飞弹。",
        "official_description": "每当皮克斯正在跟随的英雄进行攻击时，皮克斯就会发射魔法飞弹。这些飞弹会自动寻敌，但也会被其它单位所拦截。",
        "official_name": "皮克斯，仙灵伙伴",
        "raw_payload_path": "data/knowledge/raw/16.16.1/zh_CN/champion/Lulu.json",
        "slot": "passive",
        "source_ref_ids": [
          "source:ddragon:16.16.1:zh_CN:Lulu",
          "source:ddragon:16.16.1:en_US:Lulu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "effective_ddragon_version": "16.16.1",
        "effective_public_patch_alias": "26.16",
        "fact_id": "fact:Lulu:q:base:ddragon-16.16.1",
        "form_id": "base",
        "mechanics_summary": "璐璐和皮克斯分别发射穿刺飞弹，对沿途敌人造成魔法伤害和强减速。",
        "official_description": "璐璐和皮克斯各自发射一个穿刺飞弹，对命中的所有敌人造成伤害和重度减速效果。",
        "official_name": "闪耀长枪",
        "raw_payload_path": "data/knowledge/raw/16.16.1/zh_CN/champion/Lulu.json",
        "slot": "q",
        "source_ref_ids": [
          "source:ddragon:16.16.1:zh_CN:Lulu",
          "source:ddragon:16.16.1:en_US:Lulu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "effective_ddragon_version": "16.16.1",
        "effective_public_patch_alias": "26.16",
        "fact_id": "fact:Lulu:w:base:ddragon-16.16.1",
        "form_id": "base",
        "mechanics_summary": "对友军提供攻速与移速；对敌方英雄施加变形，使其暂时无法攻击或施法。",
        "official_description": "如果对友军施放，会暂时增加目标友军的攻击速度和移动速度。如果对敌人施放，会将一名敌方英雄变成可爱的动物，使其无法攻击或施法。",
        "official_name": "奇思妙想",
        "raw_payload_path": "data/knowledge/raw/16.16.1/zh_CN/champion/Lulu.json",
        "slot": "w",
        "source_ref_ids": [
          "source:ddragon:16.16.1:zh_CN:Lulu",
          "source:ddragon:16.16.1:en_US:Lulu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "effective_ddragon_version": "16.16.1",
        "effective_public_patch_alias": "26.16",
        "fact_id": "fact:Lulu:e:base:ddragon-16.16.1",
        "form_id": "base",
        "mechanics_summary": "对友军提供护盾并转移皮克斯；对敌人造成魔法伤害并提供其视野。",
        "official_description": "如果对友军施放，会命令皮克斯跳到一名友军身上进行保护，之后会跟随并协助目标（而不是璐璐）进行攻击。如果对敌人施放，皮克斯会跳到敌人身上造成伤害，之后会跟随并提供目标的视野。",
        "official_name": "帮忙，皮克斯！",
        "raw_payload_path": "data/knowledge/raw/16.16.1/zh_CN/champion/Lulu.json",
        "slot": "e",
        "source_ref_ids": [
          "source:ddragon:16.16.1:zh_CN:Lulu",
          "source:ddragon:16.16.1:en_US:Lulu"
        ]
      },
